@startuml get-manager-coffee-chat-request-pk
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/manager/v1/coffee-chat/request/{pk}
caption CRB-45 · 커피챗 요청 상세와 그 요청의 알림 발송 결과 (읽기 전용)

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ParseUUIDPipe" as Pipe
participant "ManagerCoffeeChatController" as Controller
participant "ManagerCoffeeChatService" as Service
participant "AdminCoffeeChatRequestRepository" as RequestRepository
participant "AdminNotificationLogRepository" as LogRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/manager/v1/coffee-chat/request/{pk}\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt pk가 uuid가 아님
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 Validation failed (uuid is expected)
end
Pipe -> Controller: getRequest(pk)
Controller -> Service: getRequest(pk)
Service -> RequestRepository: findByPk(pk)
RequestRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT 요청 (message · 시각) + 재학생 + 현업자\nshared_phone · shared_email은 SELECT하지 않음
PostgreSQL --> RequestRepository: row | 없음
RequestRepository --> Service: row | null
alt 없는 요청
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 404 Coffee chat request not found.
end
Service -> LogRepository: findByRequestPk(pk)
LogRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT notification_log WHERE coffee_chat_request_pk ORDER BY created_at DESC, pk DESC
PostgreSQL --> LogRepository: rows
LogRepository --> Service: rows
note right of Service
  recipient는 응답에 넣지 않음.
  error는 발송사 문구에 수신자가 섞여 있을 수 있어
  이메일 · 전화번호를 가려서 응답 (maskPersonalInfo)
end note
Service --> Controller: CoffeeChatRequestDetailDto
Controller --> Client: 200 { pk, status, student, graduated, message, created_at, graduated_viewed_at, contact_shared_at, student_viewed_at, notifications: [{ pk, event, channel, status, error, created_at }] }

@enduml
